        "type": "Module",
        "name": "power_3v3",
        "description": "AMS1117-3.3 fixed-output LDO regulator steps VIN_5V down to 3.3V. VIN pin connected to VIN_5V global rail. VOUT pin provides VCC_3V3 rail to downstream loads and monitoring circuits. GND pin connected to system ground. No external feedback divider required (fixed 3.3V output). Input and output bypass capacitors required for stability (added during schematic phase).",
        "id": "power_3v3"
      },
